00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.160
Don’t worry.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.180
We’ll still answer questions for this video
in the next one.

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:23.440
Oh, and Joee Green, I’ll ask whatever science
